      "content": "it doesnt feel like i'm still here though. it feels like i'm just watching a ghost go through the motions. the more the lights go out, the less i care about staying in the house. i'm just tired of waiting for the last one to flicker. it feels more peaceful to just... stop fighting the dark.",
